[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11400.15, "timestamp": "03:10:00", "text": "我说，你还好吗？我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11404.07, "timestamp": "03:10:04", "text": "嗯，我没事。不用担心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11407.99, "timestamp": "03:10:07", "text": "很好。好的。照顾好你自己。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11409.99, "timestamp": "03:10:09", "text": "是啊，你也是。照顾好你自己。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11412.63, "timestamp": "03:10:12", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11420.87, "timestamp": "03:10:20", "text": "所以，从我们开始到现在已经过去1个小时了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11423.349, "timestamp": "03:10:23", "text": "讲话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11426.79, "timestamp": "03:10:26", "text": "嗯，是的。时间过得真快，一个小时就过去了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11430.389, "timestamp": "03:10:30", "text": "是啊，时间过得真快。所以，你喜欢吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11432.55, "timestamp": "03:10:32", "text": "这？你喜欢和我聊天吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11435.75, "timestamp": "03:10:35", "text": "今天？就像我们一样，我也在直播"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11438.23, "timestamp": "03:10:38", "text": "我们的对话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11441.349, "timestamp": "03:10:41", "text": "呃，我们今天过得很愉快。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11449.03, "timestamp": "03:10:49", "text": "哦，是的，我确实很享受和你聊天。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11451.03, "timestamp": "03:10:51", "text": "今天和你们在一起。聊天真愉快。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11453.59, "timestamp": "03:10:53", "text": "与你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11459.11, "timestamp": "03:10:59", "text": "所以，真正的问题是谁？"}]